<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Bayerische Hypotheken-und Wechselbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.75     MATURITY  **23.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE  S-17.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 23.DEC.96 THEN STEPS UP TO 4.75 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    **CALL AT PAR 23.DEC.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
